  "note": [
    "The table the Palestinian Arabic time composer is held to.",
    "",
    "Unlike the numbers table, NONE of this has shipped before — this app",
    "has never told the time in any language. So every row here is a",
    "hypothesis, and `check` marks only the ones where two answers are",
    "both plausible and a speaker has to pick. The rest are still worth",
    "reading; they are simply not in doubt to the person who wrote them.",
    "",
    "The hour comes from the number system in ar-PS.numbers.json, asked",
    "for a feminine referent. If the hour is ever wrong here and right",
    "there, the fault is in this file's expectations and not in the",
    "composer, which has no agreement in it."
